==Battleground==
*4 [[Funghi (Enemy)|Funghi]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Funghi (Enemy)|Funghi]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Funghi (Enemy)|Funghi]] spawn, delay 3.33~4.67 seconds<sup>100f~140f</sup>.
**15 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 14.67~16.67 seconds<sup>440f~500f</sup>.
**15 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 14.67~16.67 seconds<sup>440f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Funghi Wasn't Built In a Day is a reference to the adage "[[wikipedia:Rome wasn't built in a day|Rome wasn't built in a day]]".

